# Store & Presentation

- `IRDefinitionStore` exposes GUI-operable operations over `IRDefinition` (presentation/application edge).
- `src/routes/` and `src/lib/components/` render and bind UI; they do not own transform or external-format rules.
- Do not put Reader/Writer/schema details into Svelte components — call store or thin app functions instead.
- Do not redefine SSOT (Single Source Of Truth) in the store; the store holds/references `IRDefinition`, it does not replace it.

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD — store orchestrates use of domain + ports
store.loadFromFile(path); // reader → validate → transform → set IR

// ❌ BAD — parse vendor JSON inside a Svelte component
```
